OL,3,AChemistry Nobel awarded for solving
OL,4,Amystery of life's asymmetry
OL,5,
OL,6,FLife is highly selective and only works
OL,7,Fwith one version. The two scientists
OL,8,Fanswered the question of why life
OL,9,Ffavours one of these mirror image
OL,10,Fmolecules over the other.
